{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"C1与C2文字完全相同，所有分项并列。keep：C1/C2既交代了S08的安静刚刚过去、原先难题仍在，也保留了这次迟疑背后的两重原因：害怕再次逼迫自己，以及舍不得不必防备的生活；C4次之，C3的「像当初那样不知道怎么办」容易把已有认识的变化说得不够清楚。cover：C1/C2最直接地解释了为什么原先的问题重新浮现却仍无法作答，两种相反的牵引也说明了这次迟疑为何不同于最初；C4对重新碰见旧日自己的呈现比C3更完整。lean：C1/C2从安静退去、难题仍在到认识迟疑原因，推进最紧凑；C3的挫败感和走了很远的感受尚有独立作用，C4的「熟悉的难题又回来」与「绕了这么久还是碰上那个不知怎么办的自己」则有较明显的意思重叠。plain：C1/C2最像一个人在直接讲自己的处境，句子自然，心理关系也清楚；C3的「走了这么远」比较朴素具体，C4的「碰上那个不知怎么办的自己」稍显刻意和文学化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3fe4ccd9-17b5-46b6-b683-cab4139023c5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005203816250Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:52:38.981262+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7a010466378f8dfd8f8d77fd4f843f59317d9967a02e42ec8b0893edc07b420c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\c